title: Resolve CodeRabbit round-2 findings on PR 16
description: "Eleven findings from the bot review of PR 16: an empty gate-result set deriving a pass verdict, a whitespace bypass of the duplicate-metric refusal, missing atomicity and owner pre-check in sweep planning, alias-resolved degenerate transfer comparison, unanchored section headings, per-environment invalidation caching, duplicate package entries, stored-spec candidate rule, git signing in tests, a helper return type, and a retracted upstream note."
